Z||000019||Slammed Fiero||11-22-2000||11:45 AM||||Nope , Not a member of the GTA Club. I have been meaning to join , but haven't gotten around to it. I'm more into moving events , than show and shines. My webpage is old as hell , needs to be updated , I have done a few things to my car since then. This is the list thus far<P>Ground Control Coil overs<BR>Polyurathane bushings<BR>17" TR Motorsports Typhoons<BR>225/45/17 Pirelli P Zero C's (front)<BR>245/40/17 Pirelli P Zero C's rear<BR>Pioneer DEH 6000 Cd player<BR>Sony Mobile 50X 4 amp <BR>Momo pedals<BR>Momo shifter (on short shifter)<BR>Mustang scoop in rear (Functional)<BR>Koni's all around<BR>Carrera Front springs (custom rate)<BR>Big Bars front and rear<BR>Moog problem solver ball joints.<BR>Cold air induction kit<BR>Accel coil <BR>no cat<BR>Geni Stainless steel exhaust tips<BR>original (shiny) paint<BR>I even know the guy who originally sold the car back in 1986.<P>Car is low .... a coke can will not Fit under the side of it. <P>I hope to do a motor conversion in the next year or so , the car has 50,000 miles on it , I bought it with 18,000. I drive it everywhere , Drove 10 hours to Lisa's house in Ohio (got a speeding ticket) Went to the pontiac Nationals (3rd place) Michigan show (1st place daily driver) and the GTA  show in Toronto (2nd place with a missing tail light lense) I autocross the car and run it on the track quite a bit as well...<P><BR>Jonathan McCreery<BR>||||reg||1
